{"step_index":1850,"source":"MODEL","type":"GENERIC","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-11-16T02:20:13Z","content":"Created At: 2026-11-16T09:20:13+07:00\nCompleted At: 2026-11-16T09:20:13+07:00\nShowing lines 401-517 of 517\n401: \n402: ### 11.2 Jika File Sumber adalah TXT/EPUB\n403: Langsung jalankan translator:\n404: ```cmd\n405: cmd.exe /c npx tsx translate-novel-dragndrop.ts \"NamaFile.txt\"\n406: ```\n407: \n408: ### 11.3 Kompilasi EPUB Setelah Terjemahan Selesai\n409: Siapkan folder ilustrasi di `E:\\novel yoga\\illustrations\\NamaNovel_Volume_01\\` lalu:\n410: ```cmd\n411: python compile_epub_helper.py \"NamaNovel (Terjemahan ID-Direct).txt\" \"path/ke/sumber_epub_atau_folder_ilustrasi\" \"epubs\\NamaNovel (Illustrated ID-Direct).epub\"\n412: ```\n413: \n414: ### 11.4 Audit Zero Refusal Setelah Selesai\n415: ```python\n416: # Jalankan audit ini setelah semua volume selesai\n417: import re, glob\n418: pattern = re.compile(r'apakah\\s+(kamu|anda)\\s+ingin\\s+saya|berikut\\s+adalah\\s+(ringkasan|rangkuman)|secara\\s+garis\\s+besar|tidak\\s+dapat\\s+menerjemahkan', re.I)\n419: for fn in glob.glob('*ID-Direct*.txt'):\n420:     bad = sum(1 for l in open(fn, encoding='utf-8') if pattern.search(l))\n421:     print(f'{fn}: {bad} refusal lines')\n422: ```\n423: \n424: ---\n425: \n426: ## 12. CARA MEMINDAHKAN SETUP INI KE PC BARU\n427: \n428: ### 12.1 File Wajib Disalin (Minimal)\n429: ```\n430: translate-novel-dragndrop.ts   ← Core engine (54 KB)\n431: compile_epub_helper.py         ← EPUB compiler (11 KB)\n432: extract_mushoku_helper.py      ← PDF extractor Mushoku (6 KB)\n433: extract_overlord_pdf.py        ← PDF extractor Overlord (5 KB)\n434: run_mushoku_marathon.py        ← Marathon runner (2 KB)\n435: heal_and_build_all_mushoku.py  ← Healer + EPUB builder (3 KB)\n436: DRAG_DROP_TRANSLATOR.bat       ← Windows drag & drop runner\n437: AGENTS.md                      ← Dokumen ini\n438: ```\n439: \n440: ### 12.2 Prasyarat PC Baru\n441: 1. Install **Node.js v18+**: https://nodejs.org\n442: 2. Install **9router**: `npm install -g 9router`\n443: 3. Install **tsx**: `npm install -g tsx` (atau cukup via `npx tsx`)\n444: 4. Install **Python 3.9+**: https://python.org\n445: 5. Pastikan\n<truncated 901 bytes>\nrasi sudah diekstrak ke: `E:\\novel yoga\\illustrations\\Mushoku_Tensei_Volume_XX\\`\n473: - Penanda halaman cetak (`[[PAGE:XX]]`) sudah tertanam di TXT sumber\n474: - **Bab 11 Vol 01:** Pernah terpotong prematur akibat false-positive regex. Sudah diperbaiki.\n475: - Semua 26 volume: **0 refusal line** (diverifikasi 2x audit penuh)\n476: \n477: ### Overlord [LN] (Vol 01–16)\n478: - **Sumber asli:** File EPUB individual per volume\n479: - Volume 15 & 16: sumber TXT langsung (bukan EPUB)\n480: - Semua 16 volume: **0 refusal line** (diverifikasi)\n481: - Ilustrasi tersimpan di: `E:\\novel yoga\\illustrations\\Overlord_Volume_XX\\`\n482: \n483: ### Novel Lainnya (Hobbit, Metro 2033, Rainbow Six, Horus Rising)\n484: - Sudah diterjemahkan ke TXT tapi belum dikompilasi ke EPUB berilustrasi\n485: - Cache tersedia, bisa resume/rebuild kapan saja\n486: \n487: ---\n488: \n489: ## 14. QUICK REFERENCE — PERINTAH PALING SERING DIPAKAI\n490: \n491: ```cmd\n492: :: Translate satu novel baru\n493: cmd.exe /c npx tsx translate-novel-dragndrop.ts \"NamaNovel.txt\"\n494: \n495: :: Jalankan marathon 26 volume Mushoku\n496: python run_mushoku_marathon.py\n497: \n498: :: Scan & hapus refusal halus + rebuild EPUB Mushoku\n499: python heal_and_build_all_mushoku.py\n500: \n501: :: Compile ulang satu EPUB manual\n502: python compile_epub_helper.py \"NamaNovel (Terjemahan ID-Direct).txt\" \"illustrations\\NamaNovel_Volume_01\" \"epubs\\NamaNovel (Illustrated ID-Direct).epub\"\n503: \n504: :: Aktifkan 9router (proxy LLM)\n505: cmd.exe /c \"9router -t --skip-update\"\n506: \n507: :: Cek 9router aktif\n508: curl http://127.0.0.1:20128/v1/models\n509: \n510: :: Audit refusal di semua volume (Python one-liner)\n511: python -c \"import re,glob; p=re.compile('apakah anda ingin saya|berikut adalah ringkasan',re.I); [print(f,sum(1 for l in open(f,encoding='utf-8') if p.search(l))) for f in glob.glob('*ID-Direct*.txt')]\"\n512: ```\n513: \n514: ---\n515: \n516: *Dokumen ini di-generate dan diupdate secara otomatis oleh Antigravity Agent.*\n517: *Terakhir diperbarui: November 2026 oleh Claude Sonnet 4.6 Thinking*","truncated_fields":["content"]}
